  "body": "CT reference: NA127A/641 ' \r\n\r\nTo be sold by way of Auction 2.00pm, Wednesday 25th November 2026, 30 Gaunt Street, Auckland Central\r\nUnder instruction from the first mortgagee\r\n\r\nPositioned within one of Gulf Harbour's most prestigious enclaves, 316 Pinecrest Drive presents a rare opportunity to secure a substantial coastal residence with breathtaking panoramic views across the Hauraki Gulf and towards the Waitemata Harbour.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 1,998sqm (more or less) of private, gated grounds, this solid masonry home was designed with scale, comfort and entertaining in mind. A grand entrance, generous proportions, high ceilings and multiple living areas create an immediate sense of space, while expansive windows frame the ever-changing coastal outlook beyond.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a substantial kitchen with a walk-in pantry connects seamlessly with both formal and informal living spaces. Whether hosting guests in the dining area overlooking the grounds and swimming pool, or enjoying relaxed family gatherings, the layout offers exceptional versatility for a wide range of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nDesigned for both comfortable family living and effortless entertaining, the home offers a selection of living spaces to suit every occasion. From formal gatherings to relaxed evenings with family and friends, the generous floorplan provides flexibility, functionality and room to grow.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is equally impressive. The expansive master suite enjoys stunning water views and a private ensuite with spa bath, creating a peaceful retreat at the end of the day. Additional bedrooms, bathrooms and flexible living areas provide options for extended family, guest accommodation, working from home, or multigenerational living.\r\n\r\nOutside, extensive entertaining areas, the swimming pool, established grounds and triple internal-access garaging further enhance the lifestyle on offer. Privacy, security and a highly sought-after coastal setting combine to create an environment that is both peaceful and convenient, just minutes from Gulf Harbour Marina, the golf course, beautiful beaches and local amenities.\r\n\r\nBuyers will appreciate the opportunity to refresh and personalise this substantial residence over time. With its impressive scale, solid masonry construction, prestigious setting and remarkable views, the home provides an outstanding foundation for future value and the chance to create something truly special.",
